    narr:narration """This position holds a two-part rollout plan: [sensors in all four bays before first frost, with bay two piloting first because it lost the most seedlings last winter](narr:Expr_20261014_5_Batch1Greenhouse20261014023839_h5aba624434d1_1), and [agreement on a fifteen-minute reporting interval as the threshold for catching the overnight drop](narr:Expr_20261014_5_Batch1Greenhouse20261014023839_h5aba624434d1_2).""" ;
